      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly it doesn't even make sense that VRChat doesn't resolve paths added to group short links.\n\nIf I do: vrc . group / group_code / calendar / event_id\n\nI get to a funny looking error page. I would think VRChat's resolver would resolve the group URL then append the path. But no.\n\nThis makes it hard to add event links to Discord events, for example, since Discord has a character limit in the location field.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-29T01:55:57.048Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat Event Calendar links are way longer than similar announcement links from other services like Twitter/Bluesky/etc or Timeline. \n\nGroups have a shorter URL option, https://vrc.group/[group code], why not have a similar short URL for events? Something like https://vrc.events/[calendar entry]?\n\nThanks for your consideration!",
